# A cast iron bridge railing for where the street crosses the river. One
# tile. The default frame is a straight run that tiles left to right: a round
# top rail, balusters, a flat bottom rail. The end frame is the left end post
# with a cap; the engine flips it for the right end.
sprite park-bridge-rail
size 16 16
layer object
footprint 1 1
tag rail bridge iron park

frame default
